# Frontend

- Prefer Server Components; `"use client"` only for browser APIs or interactivity.
- Mobile-first mandatory — follow `.cursor/skills/frontend-ui/SKILL.md`.
- Polish user-facing copy only.
- Public routes live in `app/(website)/`; authenticated UI in `app/(app)/` (dashboard, admin, login).
- Reuse `components/ui/` (shadcn); layout in `components/layout/`; sections in `components/sections/`.
- Do not invent routes outside `(website)` / `(app)` groups.
- Keep screens thin: fetch via existing server helpers/API; do not embed Drive/Blob/auth business logic in components.
- Affiliate narrative stays on `/wspolpraca` (and existing offer disclosure); visitor-facing home/offers use bank-offer language.
- Empty and loading states for async lists; touch targets ≥ 44px for interactive controls.
